{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/5/fa586e4720629d9efa67ae5e4d62ca6b7baa973d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{5}=2.236,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" /> the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/3/a33068e46379742b418fdf4e3c9e19c2b7b2f20e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{3-2\\sqrt{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"70\" height=\"48\" /> to the nearest hundredth is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/f/f2fe13f57385ab1e77b7ade0ed3dd8afa68b12a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad -2.25 \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad -2.35 \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad -2.15 \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad -2.20 \\quad \\text{(E)} \\quad -2.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"546\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplify the expression first:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/0/b60c3c3e49534cf2ecfdf76c9a9b5b15858a3543.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1+\\sqrt{5}}{3-2\\sqrt{5}} \\cdot \\frac{3+2\\sqrt{5}}{3+2\\sqrt{5}}=\\frac{3+3\\sqrt{5}+2\\sqrt{5}+10}{-17}=\\frac{-13+5\\sqrt{5}}{11}\\]\" width=\"451\" height=\"45\" />\nThen we can use our approximation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/2/7d2d30f0f3cdcfa70cc52743fa779cc33f4dd360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{5}=2.236.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> We see that this is closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/5/eb5cb7ff19e53a2eca50b79820981fea2cb190ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)} \\quad -2.15}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"111\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_24\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 24\"> Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_26\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041559\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 661/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 305/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1364/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.949      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    6.949      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20669:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041559 and revision id 144625. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}